// find-demo.marco — robust click-by-image: instead of a fixed coordinate, locate
// an image on screen and click it. This is what makes routes survive moved
// windows and changing layouts.
//
//   marco run --host windows programs/find-demo.marco   (needs button.png on disk + on screen)
//
// Under --host dryrun the Find/Click are logged without touching the screen.

use os.

// A find request: the template image to locate (optionally a region/tolerance).
the Target is a set.
this's Image is a text.

the Bot is an actor.

this can ClickButton.
this's ClickButton does...
    the button is a Target with Image "button.png".
    do OS's Find with button...
        when ok?
            do OS's Click with that.
            this is ok!
        or?
            this is failed with error "button not found on screen"!

the App is a script.

do Bot's ClickButton...
    when ok?
        log "clicked the button".
    or?
        log that's error.
